  4.0007772569587717`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[23]:=",ExpressionUUID->"86610aa7-fd75-442c-9a63-52f990df3680"],

Cell["\<\
Compute the height lower bound and the optima weights attaining it.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.000777518533293*^9, 4.000777519462269*^9}, {
  4.000777550065365*^9, 4.000777563295989*^9}, {4.000819383060617*^9, 
